  ('q-x2k1OPTvKlY9WUj-pdBw', 'GEM Stories', 'Blog', null, '{}'::text[], array['Trans']::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/60b3adc5e891222c2577c5c2_GEM%20Stories.jpg', 'GEM Stories seeks to amplify the voices of gender-expansive Mormons: Latter-day Saints or those adjacent to it, who are also transgender, agender, genderqueer, non-binary, intersex, two-spirit, or otherwise not cisgender.

This space cultivates support for those of us who are grappling, or have grappled, with tension between our genders, and the doctrines, teachings, and behaviors of LDS Church leaders and members. We acknowledge the unique joys and pains that come with existing in any capacity as a GE Mormon, and we affirm the spiritual paths and individual agency of every gender-expansive person.

Our hope is that in getting to know us better, LDS leaders and members can gain a greater understanding of how to minister to and love their GE siblings— and that other GE individuals will know that they aren''t alone.', 'https://gemstories.org/', null, 'transgenderdaysaints@gmail.com', null, 'https://www.facebook.com/gemormons', 'http://instagram.com/gemormons', true, null, null),
