Abortion 

For more information, hours, and to book online, please visit the Health Center Website.', null, null, null, '160 South 1000 East, Suite 120 Salt Lake City, UT 84102', null, null, false, null, null),
  ('Ex1lX0MZQJS0Jt.cuhpk0A', 'Share Your Light Support Group', 'Support Circles', 'Utah County', array['Utah County']::text[], array['LDS']::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/61733ba759f2300d0d5cbfa8_244053766_10224904060456179_6260953821558898229_n.jpg', 'A support group for parents and allies of LGBTQ+ family members. Held every 2nd Sunday of each month at the Grandview South Stake Center Relief Society Room in Provo, UT at 7:30 PM. Questions? Call or text Emily Harrison.', null, '801-830-1163', null, '1122 Grand Avenue, Provo, Utah 84604', null, null, false, null, null),
  ('MZUQsQXoTVeGFXCSOr.HOw', 'SLAQC', 'Social Groups', 'Salt Lake County', array['Salt Lake County']::text[], '{}'::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/613946d1e0e1b096225dbe1b_Copy%20of%20Location%20Icon.png', 'SLAQC is a rock climbing group for LGBTQIA+ identified folks in Salt Lake City and the Wasatch Front. We are a peer-led group whose mission is to build community, empower LGBTQIA+ individuals in the sport of rock climbing, and create a more inclusive environment in the rock climbing community as a whole. We hold regular meetup events for climbers of all skill levels at the Front in Salt Lake, and are looking to expand into more gyms in the area and organize outdoor trips in the summer.', null, null, null, null, 'https://www.facebook.com/groups/1033369770048204/', 'https://www.instagram.com/slaqueerclimbers/', false, null, null),
  ('1m1i0BRxSX6ekLG3Epc02Q', 'SLC Lesbians Bookclub', 'Social Groups', 'Salt Lake County', array['Salt Lake County']::text[], array['Lesbian']::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/61acff959d1b1647a8dd7b5e_154539694_106939338113876_6947648242697205525_n.png', '**Meetings**: The book club meets at 2 pm on the last Saturday of the month (unless noted with an *) at Under the Umbrella, our local queer bookstore. 511 W 200 S Suite 120, Salt Lake City, UT 84101. We are a trans/non-binary/bi inclusive group.

**Cost**: Please bring a contribution (sliding scale $1-5) for the meeting room reservation at Under the Umbrella. If $1 a month is a barrier for you please just reach out to  slc.lesbian.bookclub@gmail.com and let us know in advance.', 'kingsenglish.com/slc-lesbian-bookclub', null, 'slc.lesbian.bookclub@gmail.com', null, 'facebook.com/groups/160979024045091', null, true, null, null),
  ('i7EoQU0eQB2GPv0qNfRLSg', 'SLC LGBT+ Friendly Housing', 'Queer Housing', null, '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/611b3421de6130364257491f_29472429_10156286167486683_3775308461143752704_n.jpg', 'LGBT+ Friendly Housing was created so that the LGBT+ community could have a space to more easily and safely find housing opportunities in Utah.

3 Easy Rules - If you can''t follow them you will be removed from the group:
1- No bullying or hate speech.
2- Be kind ❤️
3- If you have any questions or concerns, contact group creator, Lauren Hamilton directly.', null, null, null, null, 'https://www.facebook.com/groups/209397079601455', null, false, null, null),
  ('ohW0zPLdRpChia8Hiufk.w', 'SLC Queer Housing', 'Queer Housing', 'Salt Lake County', array['Salt Lake County']::text[], '{}'::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/611494010dac64fbb6df8b36_groups-default-cover-photo-2x.png', 'A Facebook group for those looking for queer freindly housing in Salt Lake City.', null, null, null, null, 'https://www.facebook.com/groups/1910230212576888/about', null, false, null, null),
  ('KkZWarOhQbK2n.ar2PUMiA', 'SLCC Queer Student Association', 'College Resources', 'Salt Lake County', array['Salt Lake County']::text[], '{}'::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/611b35785c8255f3da67bfd2_download%20(4).png', 'Queer Student Association is a social support & educational group for LGBTQ+ people & their allies. We are dedicated to promoting openness and equality, maintaining confidentiality, supporting diversity, serving the public, and furthering a positive image for the LGBTQ+ community.

Salt Lake Community College has a strong initiative to enhance the quality of life of lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer, and questioning SLCC students, faculty, and staff in an environment that is welcoming, positive, and safe, by increasing the SLCC community''s awareness, understanding, and inclusion of its lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer, and questioning members. We will achieve this mission by providing:

Resources to LGBTQ+ students, staff, and faculty

Resources to allies

Education on the terminology, the history, and the current issues effecting the LGBTQ+ community

Safe Zone traini', 'http://www.slcc.edu/lgbtq/queer-student-association.aspx', null, 'SafeZone@slcc.edu', '4600 South Redwood Road, Salt Lake City, UT 84123', null, null, true, null, null),
  ('dx4-2ZobSOWCWmuD4P7XUQ', 'So You''re Mormon and Gay', 'Blog', null, '{}'::text[], array['LDS']::text[], 'https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f2ad784e8fae48bcf796a04/60534d7664edf561c5ffb750_IMG_20210317_221620_562.jpg', 'Hi, I''m Kelly! I''m 29 years old, born and raised in the San Francisco Bay Area, and currently living and working in Salt Lake City. I am the youngest in a family of five and was spoiled and loved like crazy (the youngest child spot is definitely the best in my opinion). I love being outside, traveling, and all sports, especially basketball (go Warriors!). I played basketball at Lehigh University during my undergrad and then went on to graduate school at BYU. I joined the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints in 2010 when I was 19, served a mission in Nagoya, Japan (日本が大好き!), and occassionally attend my ward in Salt Lake. Oh, and yes, I''m gay!


I wanted to create this blog to share my own story and the stories of my LGBTQ Mormon friends. When I started to realize I might be gay (it only took me 23 years to realize my "really close friendships" and "girl crushes" might be something ', 'soyouremormonandgay.blogspot.com', null, null, null, null, 'https://instagram.com/soyouremormonandgay?igshid=1hosg6gop3nwv', false, null, null),
